# ============================================================
#  What does NOT belong in the repository
# ============================================================

# THE RELEASE ZIPS. Each one is built with `git archive` from a commit that
# is already here, so committing it would put a second, heavier copy of the
# repository inside the repository — and a stale one the moment anything
# changes. They are how a release is handed over, not part of it.
#
# There is a second reason on this project: Cloudflare Pages publishes this
# branch as the preview site from the repository root, so a zip committed
# here would be served as a public download of the whole codebase.
aureum-v*.zip
*.zip

# Editor and operating-system leftovers.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Local tooling, if anything is ever installed here. Nothing in js/ is
# built or bundled — the site is served exactly as it is committed — so
# these are listed to keep an accident out, not to describe a build.
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
